'''Paper''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is white with a sketch of a blade imprinted on it. The guard is also white with graphite streaks on it. The handle is made up of many small black dots.

== Trivia ==
* It has a partner gun under the name [[Sketch]].

